              "kind": "text",
              "text": "Viviana's voiceover delivers the opening hook: “I feel like what I always saw or referenced were these, like, big, hearty old school books that never really talked about color had super fun things to do in them. Um, very like old school pottery.” but cut all the silences and uhms",
